<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge rose to 75.3998 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge rose to 75.3998 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.3998 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Monday after 75.6999 on Friday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     Apr 14		  Apr 11</p>
<p> High			     75.5900		 75.7950</p>
<p> Low				75.3998		 75.6000</p>
<p> Open			     75.4100		 75.6000</p>
<p> Close			    75.3998		 75.6999</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)	     4.775		   4.530</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
